    {
      "source": "Handle an auto-configuration import event.",
      "translation": "处理自动配置导入事件。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "An <a href=\"AutoConfigurationImportListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>AutoConfigurationImportListener</code></a> may implement any of the following\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/Aware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>Aware</code></a> interfaces, and their respective\nmethods will be called prior to\n<a href=\"#onAutoConfigurationImportEvent(org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.AutoConfigurationImportEvent)\"><code>onAutoConfigurationImportEvent(AutoConfigurationImportEvent)</code></a>:",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"AutoConfigurationImportListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>AutoConfigurationImportListener</code></a>` 可以实现以下任意一个 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/Aware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>Aware</code></a>` 接口，其相应的方法将在调用 `<a href=\"#onAutoConfigurationImportEvent(org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.AutoConfigurationImportEvent)\"><code>onAutoConfigurationImportEvent(AutoConfigurationImportEvent)</code></a>` 之前被调用：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>event</code> - the event to respond to",
      "translation": "<code>event</code> - 要响应的事件",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This is a functional interface and can therefore be used as the assignment target for a lambda expression or method reference.",
      "translation": "这是一个函数式接口，因此可用作 Lambda 表达式或方法引用的赋值目标。",
      "count": 2
